WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320
Don't take a break either. Go wash the vegetables and cook a big pot of rice.

2
00:00:04,410 --> 00:00:05,730
Kiss two meaty mouthfuls

3
00:00:05,930 --> 00:00:07,530
Even the business name is considered a success

4
00:00:07,530 --> 00:00:18,500
The men went out to plant flags

5
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:19,900
The land was also given to me

6
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:21,930
A bunch of people spilled out

7
00:00:21,930 --> 00:00:23,650
How many drops can you give me in one day?

8
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:27,940
This reaches out

9
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:30,260
Why are you more harsh than the captain?

10
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:31,340
Want to learn secretly

11
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:41,500
Do your work and go to Yang Zi's house where you can stay.

12
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:42,420
Stay outside the cave

13
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:44,620
Keep an eye on the entire base for me
